'''Buddhistic''' (bö-dis′tik), ''a.'' [< ''Buddhist'' + ''-ic.''] Pertaining to Buddhism: as, ''Buddhistic'' literature. Also ''Boodhistic.''

'''Buddhistical''' (bö-dis′ti-kal), ''a.'' Same as ''Buddhistic.'' Also ''Boodhistical.''

